{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For he is her father's brother.</b> A relative of her father — as in ״אַחִים אֲנָחְנוּ״, 'we are relatives.' And its midrash: if he comes with cunning, I too am his brother in cunning; and if he is an honest man, I too am the son of Rivkah his honest sister." "<b>And she told her father.</b> Because her mother had died, and she had no one to tell but him (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:04.365990254Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}